Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.18,0:03:32.73,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.38,0:03:35.26,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}命さえ晒し唄えば
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.19,0:03:37.58,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.59,0:03:40.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}今に分かることだ
